# Azog, Moria's Ruin: "Its controller amasses Goblins X ... If you controlled that creature, draw a card." Bot1 controls Bot2's Llanowar Elves through Mind Control. Azog destroys it:
# the Elves goes to its owner Bot2's graveyard, but Bot1 is the controller it was destroyed under (judged before it goes, CR 608.2h), so Bot1 - not Bot2 - amasses Goblins 1
# (a 1/1 Goblin Army for Bot1) and draws a card. Hand: a Plains drawn on each of turns 3 and 5 plus the card from Azog.

